31. Section 23(1), which alone is relevant for our present purposes, is extracted as follows:
"23, Matters to be considered in determining compensation - (1) In determining the amount of compensation to be awarded for land acquired under this Act, the Court shall take into consideration first, the market value of the land at the date of the publication of the notification under Section 4, sub-section (1);
secondly the damage sustained by the person interested, by reason of the taking of WP-15256-2025.odt 14 of 21 any standing crops or trees which may be on the land at the time of the Collector's taking possession thereof;
